---
import BaseHead from '../../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE, PHONE, PHONE_TEL } from '../../consts';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
	<BaseHead title={`Drain Cleaning Santa Clarita CA | ${SITE_TITLE}`} description="Professional drain cleaning in Santa Clarita, CA. Kitchen, bathroom, laundry, and main line clearing with modern equipment and lasting results." />
</head>
<body>
	<Header />

	<section class="page-hero">
		<div class="container">
			<h1>Professional Drain Cleaning</h1>
			<p>Fast, thorough clearing of clogged drains throughout Santa Clarita homes and businesses.</p>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="content">
		<div class="container">
			<div class="content-grid">
				<div>
					<h2>Expert Drain Cleaning for Santa Clarita Homes</h2>
					<p>Clogged drains are more than an inconvenience — they can lead to slow drains, foul odors, and eventual backups. We use professional-grade equipment to clear kitchen sinks, bathroom drains, showers, tubs, laundry lines, and floor drains without harsh chemicals that can damage pipes.</p>
					<p>Our technicians assess the situation, choose the right method (mechanical snakes, hydro jetting when appropriate, or targeted clearing), and restore full flow so you can get back to normal quickly.</p>
					
					<h3>What’s Included</h3>
					<ul>
						<li>On-site evaluation of the affected drain(s)</li>
						<li>Professional mechanical or hydro cleaning as needed</li>
						<li>Removal of grease, hair, soap scum, and soft blockages</li>
						<li>Basic recommendations to help prevent future clogs</li>
						<li>Cleanup of the work area</li>
					</ul>
				</div>
				<div>
					<h3>Why Professional Cleaning Matters</h3>
					<p>Store-bought chemicals and DIY snakes often only punch a temporary hole in a clog. Professional equipment removes the bulk of the material so the problem is less likely to return quickly. We also protect older or fragile piping common in some Santa Clarita neighborhoods.</p>
					
					<h3>Common Drain Issues We Handle</h3>
					<ul>
						<li>Kitchen sink and garbage disposal backups</li>
						<li>Bathroom sink, tub, and shower clogs</li>
						<li>Laundry and utility sink slowdowns</li>
						<li>Floor drain and basement issues</li>
					</ul>
					
					<div class="mt-2">
						<a href="/contact/" class="btn btn-primary">Request Drain Cleaning Quote</a>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="cta">
		<div class="container">
			<h2>Ready to Clear That Clog?</h2>
			<p>Call today for fast, professional drain cleaning in Santa Clarita.</p>
			<a href={`tel:${PHONE_TEL}`} class="btn btn-primary">Call {PHONE}</a>
		</div>
	</section>

	<Footer />
</body>
</html>
